  m_Name: Dayne1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: Evening, traveller. If you're thinking of heading up the volcano, I'd be
    careful. I tried going up earlier, there was some mad cult living up there. Barely
    made it out with my life.
  option1:
    text: What happened?
